                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Aesthetically this game is fantastic! It has it's own unique and compelling art style, easy to understand and fun gameplay and of course, a great music to tie it all together while you are swearing at your friend!\n\nEach time you complete a level or game with our friend, you gain exp and the ability to unlock characters, levels etc. Which will soon get you hooked!\n\nIt's a great party game, I played it with only one other friend but I can imagine the chaos of trying to hold my own in a 4 player game (the good kind of chaos, of course!)\n\nI would definitely recommend this game, especially if you and your friends enjoy screaming at each other.",
